      "title": "Boyd Gaming (BYD) \u2014 A Winning Bet for Long-Term Investors?",
      "fund": "Substack / Priced to Own (Chris Burke)",
      "date": "October 30, 2024",
      "summary": "Boyd Gaming represents a disciplined regional casino owner-operator delivering return on capital above 40% and utility-like cash flows while retaining real estate ownership to preserve balance sheet resilience. Trading at ~8.5x P/FCF and EV/EBIT, the valuation drops to ~7.5x when stripping out its 5% equity stake in FanDuel (estimated at $1 billion). Key catalysts include steady mid-single-digit organic growth, substantial share count reduction (over 17% repurchased in recent years), and conservative capital deployment.",
      "url": "https://pricedtoown.substack.com/p/boyd-gaming-byd-a-winning-bet-for",
      "btn_label": "Substack Memo \u2197"
    },
    {
      "title": "Thoughts on Boyd Gaming (the other BYD)",
      "fund": "r/ValueInvesting",
      "date": "September 30, 2025",
      "summary": "This due diligence highlights Boyd Gaming's dominance in niche regional and Las Vegas Locals markets (55% Midwest/South, 24% Vegas Locals, 11% Online) with sticky, budget-conscious core customers generating tech-like operating margins at ~13x P/E. The breakdown stresses Boyd's pristine capital allocation, manageable net debt (~2.6x), ongoing buybacks, and expanding digital presence. Long-term operational catalysts include property expansions such as Cadence Crossing and the $750 million casino resort development in Norfolk, Virginia.",
      "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/ValueInvesting/search/?q=BYD&restrict_sr=1&sort=top",
      "btn_label": "Reddit DDs \u2197"
    },
    {
      "title": "Boyd Gaming: Not Every Catalyst Comes Overnight",
      "fund": "Seeking Alpha / Pedro Goulart",
      "date": "July 28, 2026",
      "summary": "The write-up builds a high-conviction bull case targeting $109 per share, arguing that sell-side models under-value BYD at 6-7x EBITDA compared to its pre-COVID ~10x historic average and a ~10% total shareholder yield. Core strength in Midwest & South operations and high-margin asset-light managed fees (Sky River Casino) offset temporary renovation drag in Las Vegas. Furthermore, following its FanDuel equity stake monetization, management holds the strongest balance sheet in company history to fund growth projects.",
      "url": "https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BYD/analysis",
      "btn_label": "Seeking Alpha \u2197"
    },
